<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>DQ Fountain Drinks</h2>
<p>DQ is a Coca-Cola fountain operator, so the soft-drink lineup is the familiar Coke family: Coca-Cola, Diet Coke, Coke Zero, Sprite, Dr Pepper, and Fanta or lemonade at some locations. Fountain availability varies slightly by store, but the core Coke products are consistent nationwide.</p>
<h2>Sizes, Prices, and Calories</h2>
<p>Soft drinks start at $2.11 for a small and scale up by size. Calories depend entirely on your choice: a large regular soda can reach around 310 calories, while any of the diet or zero-sugar options are effectively 0 calories at every size. If you are watching calories, the zero-sugar sodas are the easy swap.</p>
<h2>Cheaper as Part of a Deal</h2>
<p>A soft drink is included in most DQ combos and meal deals, so if you are ordering food it is almost always cheaper to get the drink as part of a <a href="/combos">deal</a> — such as the <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal</a> — than to add it separately. Refill policies vary by location; dine-in stores more often offer free refills than drive-through-only sites.</p>
    <h2>Related Items</h2>
    <ul><li><a href="/items/misty-slush">Arctic Rush Misty Slush — from $2.39</a></li><li><a href="/items/chocolate-shake">Chocolate Shake — $3.49</a></li><li><a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal (drink included)</a></li><li><a href="/categories/drinks">All DQ Drinks</a></li></ul>
